{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18497","headline":"荆南夏夜水楼怀昭丘直上人云梦李莘 · 欧阳詹","name":"荆南夏夜水楼怀昭丘直上人云梦李莘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无机成旅逸，中夜上江楼。\n云尽月如练，水凉风似秋。\n凫声闻梦泽，黛色上昭丘。\n不远人情在，良宵恨独游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}